  "body": "templates/voice/eleven_voice.py generates one clip per script beat (`b01 Sentence...` lines) through the ElevenLabs with-timestamps endpoint and assembles voice.wav, words.json (word timings straight from the API, no speech-to-text pass) and beats.json (beat start/end in seconds and frames for timing the shots).\n\nOptions cover the usual revision loop: --only to redo single beats, comma-separated --voice ids to compare voices, --starts to keep redone beats on already-timed frames, --min-frames to match the composition length, --list-voices. Standard library + ffmpeg only.\n\nThe API key is read only from ELEVENLABS_API_KEY; SKILL.md tells the agent never to write it into files. SKILL.md step 3 and README updated.",
